@startuml TensorFlow数据架构图
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

title TensorFlow数据架构图 (TOGAF Data Architecture)

package "数据模型" {
  [张量 (Tensor)] as Tensor
  [变量 (Variable)] as Variable
  [数据集 (Dataset)] as Dataset
  [稀疏张量 (SparseTensor)] as SparseTensor
  [RaggedTensor] as RaggedTensor
}

package "数据流" {
  [前向传播] as ForwardProp
  [反向传播] as BackwardProp
  [梯度计算] as GradientCompute
  [优化器更新] as OptimizerUpdate
}

package "数据存储" {
  [检查点 (Checkpoint)] as Checkpoint
  [SavedModel] as SavedModel
  [TFRecord] as TFRecord
  [CSV文件] as CSVFile
  [图像文件] as ImageFile
}

package "数据格式" {
  [Protobuf] as Protobuf
  [GraphDef] as GraphDef
  [HLO (High Level Optimizer)] as HLO
  [MLIR] as MLIR
  [FlatBuffer] as FlatBuffer
}

package "数据管理" {
  [版本控制] as VersionControl
  [序列化] as Serialization
  [反序列化] as Deserialization
  [数据验证] as DataValidation
  [数据转换] as DataTransform
}

package "数据管道" {
  [数据读取] as DataRead
  [数据预处理] as DataPreprocess
  [数据批处理] as DataBatch
  [数据缓存] as DataCache
  [数据增强] as DataAugment
}

' 数据模型关系
Tensor --> Variable
Tensor --> SparseTensor
Tensor --> RaggedTensor
Dataset --> Tensor

' 数据流关系
Tensor --> ForwardProp
ForwardProp --> BackwardProp
BackwardProp --> GradientCompute
GradientCompute --> OptimizerUpdate
OptimizerUpdate --> Variable

' 数据存储关系
Variable --> Checkpoint
Tensor --> SavedModel
SavedModel --> GraphDef
Dataset --> TFRecord
Dataset --> CSVFile
Dataset --> ImageFile

' 数据格式关系
GraphDef --> Protobuf
SavedModel --> Protobuf
Checkpoint --> Protobuf
TFRecord --> Protobuf
HLO --> Protobuf
MLIR --> Protobuf
FlatBuffer --> SavedModel

' 数据管理关系
SavedModel --> Serialization
Checkpoint --> Serialization
Serialization --> Deserialization
Deserialization --> SavedModel
Deserialization --> Checkpoint
SavedModel --> VersionControl
Checkpoint --> VersionControl
Tensor --> DataValidation
Dataset --> DataValidation
DataValidation --> DataTransform

' 数据管道关系
TFRecord --> DataRead
CSVFile --> DataRead
ImageFile --> DataRead
DataRead --> DataPreprocess
DataPreprocess --> DataAugment
DataAugment --> DataBatch
DataBatch --> DataCache
DataCache --> Dataset

' 数据流与数据管道的连接
Dataset --> ForwardProp

note right of Tensor
  多维数组，TensorFlow的
  核心数据结构
end note

note right of Variable
  可训练的模型参数
  支持梯度更新
end note

note right of SavedModel
  标准模型保存格式
  包含图结构和权重
end note

note right of GraphDef
  计算图的序列化格式
  使用Protobuf编码
end note

note right of HLO
  XLA的高级中间表示
  用于图优化和编译
end note

note right of MLIR
  多级中间表示
  支持多种编译器后端
end note

note right of TFRecord
  TensorFlow的高效
  二进制数据格式
end note

@enduml

